WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.700
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.300
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:24.000
You are my sun now

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.420
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.420
no matter who you are

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.840
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.560
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:50.940
is clear again

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:56.320
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.830
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:05.160
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:08.790
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:16.630
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:23.470
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:30.860
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:38.200
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:02.540
<i>Lief defeated Dain and recovered the Belt.</i>

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:09.700
<i>But, a wounded Doom was captured
along with Jasmine and Barda.</i>

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:17.300
<i>Fallow demanded that Lief bring the Belt to
him in exchange for the safety of his friends</i>

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>with a wicked smile across his face.</i>

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.000
<i>Lief went to the palace's
hidden room for the time being,</i>

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.600
<i>which was where the representatives of
the seven tribes were waiting in hiding.</i>

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.550
A dead end?!

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.700
Don't worry.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:52.900
Here.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.600
Wow.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.360
I never knew the palace had
secret passageways like these!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:09.400
There are a number of hidden
corridors throughout Del Palace.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:15.740
There are also several contingencies set up in
different places in case the palace is attacked.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:21.900
These are known only to the Ralad tribe,
as it's been passed down from generation to generation.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.000
I see.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.250
Having you with us is a great help, Manus.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.400
We're here.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.770
All of you... I'm so glad to see you.

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.950
Lief!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.730
Thank goodness you're safe and well.

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:49.100
And you also, Manus.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.570
So, what happened with Dain?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.000
Dain...

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.330
has been defeated.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:02.600
But, if I don't surrender the Belt,
Jasmine and the others will be...

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.000
What should we do?

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:12.200
We will rescue them!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.890
And, we'll do it without giving
up the Belt, no matter what!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.300
Right.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:23.500
Okay.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.300
Zeean, Fardeep,

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.400
and Steven; the three of you will stay here.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:32.900
Understood.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:37.910
Gla-Thon, Glock and Nanion will accompany me.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.000
Right.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.500
Alright.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.910
I'll be at your side.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.300
I'll come too.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:44.910
I can lead the way.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.300
Please do.

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.000
Jasmine...

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.200
Jasmine...

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.950
Our brave...

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.300
little...

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:09.690
daughter... our daughter...

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.900
"Our daughter?"

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.400
It can't be...

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.910
Doom is...

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.780
You poor thing...

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:28.600
No one to play with but
the birds and the animals...

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.400
In the Forests of Silence...

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:34.300
there is nothing but fear...

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.200
Doom is...

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.590
my... father?

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:45.250
Are his memories returning...?

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.000
There is no escape...

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:49.600
from this forest...

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:54.200
Everyone who tried to escape and
bring their children with them...

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.700
they were all killed...!

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.360
Hang in there, Doom!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:06.500
Need to stay here...

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.900
to survive...

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.900
I'm... sorry...

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.000
No way...

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:20.890
Doom...!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:32.700
You three will be used as bait
to lure the other rats out.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:44.370
Do you know where Jasmine
and the rest are being held?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:48.120
Fallow told me to come to the throne room.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:52.120
In that case, we'll have to travel
through the palace on the inside.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.590
Are we going to climb up from here?

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:59.300
Yeah. There is an armoury right above us.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.400
That works perfectly.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.340
Indeed.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.860
It's clear. Nobody's here.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:29.600
There's a lot of nasty stuff
in here, just as I thought.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.580
Let's take these along with us.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.580
Yeah.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:40.300
There is a corridor on the
other side of the armoury door.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.300
Okay.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:44.300
There are probably guards outside, then.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.600
W-What?!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.000
Let's take a look!

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.800
I don't see anything unusual...

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:04.400
There they are!

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:06.400
After them!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:09.030
They're over here!

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:24.930
Lord Fallow, reporting!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.430
The enemy is making their move.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.100
What?

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:32.000
The rats have started moving?

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.300
Quite a reckless lot, aren't they?

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:38.700
Lief...

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.530
Where's the throne room?

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.900
The innermost room of the palace!

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.410
The innermost?!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:53.100
Will we reach Jasmine and the others,

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:55.700
or will the Grey Guards take us out before then?

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.400
Either way, we have to try!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.300
More of them are coming.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.500
They're here!

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:04.800
After them!

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:06.400
Don't let them get away!

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.470
Over here!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.970
Take the next right!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:20.440
Manus!

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.000
Don't worry.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.300
You can go on ahead.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.700
What is this?!

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.900
If you think you can catch us, then be our guest!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.670
We have no choice but to fight, then?!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.680
I'm sick of looking at you all!

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.600
Everyone, hurry and get up here!

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.300
After them!

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:15.830
I won't let you go a step further!

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.600
You're amazing, Manus!

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.460
It's my ancestors you should praise.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.700
The throne room is just up ahead.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.200
Jasmine, Barda, Doom,

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.600
please be safe!

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.430
Good grief...

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.690
It doesn't look like they'll just let us go.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:42.400
Keep running until we're in the throne room!

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.200
Come on!!

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.600
Jasmine!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:00.300
Barda!

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:07.900
What?

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:10.050
There's nobody here!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.800
They're not here...?

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:26.610
By now, those fools have probably been
cornered, left to be slaughtered by the guards!

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.800
There's no way that's true!

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.530
Lief...

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:36.330
Once the Belt is in my possession,
I will have no further use for you.

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:41.000
I will deal with you later at my leisure.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.100
We're surrounded!

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:13.000
Fire!!

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.800
Lief, let's go!

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.900
Pursue!

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.500
Where are Jasmine and the others?!

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:01.670
Kree!

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:07.250
Thank you, Kree.

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:13.300
I hope that Lief and the rest
will realise that we're here.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:26.600
That's Kree over there!

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:28.900
Jasmine and the others must be in that tower!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.300
There they are! Seize them!

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:34.600
We'll cover you.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.400
Go, Lief!

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.400
Now!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:40.500
Let's go.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.000
Okay.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.500
I'll leave it to you!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.500
Please do!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.000
Don't let them get away!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.050
I won't let you interfere!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.300
Take this!!

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.200
Here!

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:26.410
Alright!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.430
Stop right there!!

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:50.000
<i>This is bad...!</i>

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.300
They made it inside!

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:03.000
Let's get going as well!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:03.900
Right!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:08.910
Manus!

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.700
Are you alright?

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.400
Yeah. What about you?

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:14.920
I'm fine. Let's continue up.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:17.380
Yeah. Let's go!

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:26.700
With a noisy bell like that, the rats
are sure to gather somewhere...

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:30.400
Find them, and drag them out of their holes!

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.600
It's Lief!

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.900
Lief must be coming here!

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.520
Jasmine!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:38.700
Lief!

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:40.400
Jasmine!

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:49.790
Lief!!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.550
He's still alive?!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.790
Those persistent bastards!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.550
Gla-Thon, Nanion, come here!

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.020
Jasmine! We'll be right there!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.530
Alright!

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:26.660
What are you doing?! Sever the rope!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.600
Lief, this is really dangerous!

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.500
I know.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.600
But, I have to go!

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:45.010
Fire! Shoot now!

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.760
Shoot him down!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.470
Stop!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.470
Oh no!

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:51.000
What?!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.000
Shoot him! Shoot him!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.200
They didn't explode?!

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.330
What is the meaning of this?!

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:27.900
We Dread Gnomes began swapping the contents of the blisters we give to the Grey Guards.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.300
Instead of Gellick's poison, we just
filled them with water mixed with resin.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.500
Lief!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:33.500
Lief!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.900
We're finally together again, Barda,

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.400
Jasmine!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.700
Are you okay, Doom?

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:45.400
Jasmine...

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.100
My...

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.600
beautiful...

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:54.200
daughter...

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.400
Jasmine...

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:58.700
I'm here.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:02.100
"My beautiful daughter"?!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:08.200
It would appear... that Doom is Jasmine's father.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.930
Huh?! He's what?!

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.000
His memories...

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.810
seem to be coming back.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:23.600
And it looks like Doom fled from
somewhere with Jasmine's mother.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.000
Fled from somewhere...

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:32.620
to where Jasmine was born;
the Forests of Silence...

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.400
Which means, then...

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:39.400
it's possible that Jasmine is the heir?

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:50.900
You're mistaken, Lief.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.640
I'm not the royal heir.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.700
But, you may not know that for sure yourself.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.800
My memory is faint,

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:10.700
but I do know that my mother
and father weren't royalty.

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:15.700
As well as that, when I touched
the Belt, nothing happened.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:22.000
In that case, we can be certain that Jasmine is not the royal heir, then.

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:27.800
Then, where on earth is the true royal heir...?

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:29.100
We're in trouble!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.100
Lief!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.300
We'll worry about that later, look below!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.900
Can you hear me, you damned hooligans?

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.420
Since it's come to this, I will just
incinerate you along with the Belt!

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:41.950
Set it alight!

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.600
Oh no, our escape route!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:02.700
This is bad. What should we do?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.580
There must be some way out of here!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.200
I just heard... a voice?

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.400
Lief! Lief!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.300
Lief!

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:28.440
Lief!

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:29.690
Prin!

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.190
Lief!

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.700
Prin...

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:38.000
Hold on, the others are coming too!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:43.400
Long time no see Lief, Barda, Jasmine!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:45.400
We're here to rescue you.

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:47.670
That was quite close, wasn't it?

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.880
Bruna, Ailsa, Merin!

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.100
You're here!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.600
Thank you!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:57.700
Now, let's hurry and get out of here!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.000
Shoot them when they try to fly out!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:03.900
Yes sir!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:05.600
What?!

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.600
Now, Lief!

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:11.770
Let's go!

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:22.700
Shit...!

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:24.700
These people are unbelievable!

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.800
Put out the fire! Put it out!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:27.800
Yes sir!

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:33.100
Prin! Thank you!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.400
Jasmine!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:38.760
Thank you so much, Prin.

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:42.400
It's nothing, I'm glad to be able to help.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.500
Lief!

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:58.400
Now, hand me the Belt, Lief!

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:06.500
Or, would you prefer to see your parents die?

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:20.700
Come, give me the Belt!

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:25.800
If you don't, I will execute your parents!

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:53.260
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:59.060
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:05.610
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:11.400
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:18.370
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.960
At this point

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:27.630
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:33.930
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:40.270
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:47.360
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:55.700
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:08.900
The Seven Gems: the Diamond.

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:13.400
<i>The final gem, found in the Valley of the Lost
and belonging to the Jalis tribe.</i>

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:15.300
<i>It represents purity and power.</i>

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:19.750
<i>It dislikes violence and
dishonesty, and bestows good luck.</i>

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:24.220
At long last, the time to fight Fallow has arrived.

00:24:24.220 --> 00:24:27.600
If we defeat him, then peace
should return to Deltora!

00:24:28.200 --> 00:24:30.800
But, there's something that I still don't know.

00:24:30.730 --> 00:24:34.690
Who is the True Heir?

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:34.690
Next time, 'Who is the True Heir?'

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
